===Etymology===
From {{inh|et|fiu-fin-pro|*kakci}}, from {{inh|et|fiu-pro|*kakta}}. The final vowel was modified by analogy with {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*ükci||one}}. Cognate with Finnish {{m|fi|kaksi}} and Hungarian {{m|hu|két}}.

